Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.01,0:00:37.02,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,"Itazura na Kiss" The \NMovie Production Committee
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.10,0:00:42.81,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,Tonan University
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.53,0:00:50.24,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,"The 1st year on campus"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.61,0:00:54.95,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,"Spring"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.41,0:00:55.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey there, you beauties!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.29,0:00:56.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.46,0:01:04.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.50,0:01:08.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Clubs in college really \Nrecruit aggressively...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.21,0:01:11.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I wonder which Irie is gonna join?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.47,0:01:12.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You already live together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.72,0:01:14.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And you wanna be in the same club, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.93,0:01:16.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Clingy Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.18,0:01:17.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.60,0:01:20.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We don't talk much at home anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.44,0:01:23.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,so I was hoping I could \Njoin the same group...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.82,0:01:26.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.82,0:01:27.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.73,0:01:28.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.48,0:01:33.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I got the feeling someone was watching us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.41,0:01:42.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here! Room 201.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.67,0:01:44.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This is our classroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.71,0:01:47.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The Literature Department! \NDoesn't get more collegiate than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.34,0:01:50.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,After being a loser in high school,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.34,0:01:54.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I can finally start over! \NThis place is an oasis!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.06,0:02:04.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Excuse me? May I sit here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.11,0:02:07.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Wait, aren't you Mayu?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.86,0:02:11.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,who graduated from Tonan last year?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.36,0:02:14.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko! Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.07,0:02:15.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It really has been so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.41,0:02:16.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Good to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.91,0:02:20.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, you look like the \Nmodel of a college girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.54,0:02:22.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I didn't recognize you at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.41,0:02:24.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.12,0:02:27.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.17,0:02:29.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I actually failed last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.17,0:02:31.46,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So I'm starting over from scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.76,0:02:34.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Nice to see you all again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.72,0:02:36.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.68,0:02:38.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hello, Jinko. It’s been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.22,0:02:41.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Getting to take the escalator is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.06,0:02:43.77,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah, really. It's fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.77,0:02:45.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right, talk to you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.19,0:02:45.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.73,0:02:46.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.61,0:02:58.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Something about this class...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.28,0:03:00.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Is giving me intense class F vibes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.84,0:03:12.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Congratulations on getting accepted!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.17,0:03:15.43,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Welcome to Liberal Arts, \NDepartment of Japanese Literature.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.05,0:03:18.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.34,0:03:22.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,If you can't make the grade, you will be failed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.18,0:03:23.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Especially here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.64,0:03:26.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,the department of Japanese \NLiterature, every year,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.19,0:03:28.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,has a lot of repeaters!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.36,0:03:33.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don't let them label us \N"The university's class F" again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.44,0:03:35.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I thought I finally got rid of
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.95,0:03:38.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,the stink of class F...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.12,0:03:41.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Jinko, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.66,0:03:45.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I guess we'll never get out from \Nthe shadow of class F after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.37,0:03:46.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're right...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.87,0:03:49.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No matter where we go, \Nwe're always gonna be Fs.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.88,0:03:53.46,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Work, marriage, posthumous title...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.46,0:03:55.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It'll even be on our tombstones!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.01,0:03:56.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Posthumous title?'
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.13,0:03:57.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,On our tombstones...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.30,0:03:59.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Come on Jinko,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.51,0:04:02.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,maybe getting something sweet \Nat the cafeteria will cheer you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.72,0:04:04.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.19,0:04:09.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.90,0:04:12.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Did anything new happen \Nwith Irie over spring break?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.82,0:04:16.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You've been living together \Nfor nearly a year, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.15,0:04:17.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.28,0:04:21.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But, nothing happened... \Nduring the spring holiday.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.99,0:04:23.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.79,0:04:25.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,As usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.08,0:04:30.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Wait, the way you said that...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.00,0:04:35.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So something happened before or after?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.84,0:04:37.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Just say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.72,0:04:39.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.47,0:04:42.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,on the day of our graduation,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.72,0:04:46.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,he kissed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.73,0:04:52.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,A kiss?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.86,0:05:01.11,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,Itazura na Kiss the Movie 2: Campus Chapter
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.08,0:05:05.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The Science and \NEngineering Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.99,0:05:07.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let's get in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.45,0:05:09.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Wait, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.91,0:05:11.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.17,0:05:13.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We're gonna peek in on your darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.10,0:05:25.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.43,0:05:31.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko wanted to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.02,0:05:32.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.06,0:05:35.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Actually, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.86,0:05:39.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Since it's such a pleasant day,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.36,0:05:42.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I was wondering what the desks \Nwere like in the science department...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.36,0:05:44.45,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Just kinda curious...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.95,0:05:48.74,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie, is this your girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.70,0:05:50.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.16,0:05:53.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's ridiculous?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.50,0:05:55.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah, that makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.88,0:05:57.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I mean, you and her...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.59,0:06:02.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What's that chuckle mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.59,0:06:06.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie, let's drop by the cafe \Nand get something to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.18,0:06:07.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.06,0:06:18.40,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,Puffer House
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.36,0:06:22.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,A toast to to Naoki and Kotoko,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.32,0:06:24.45,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,who are now officially college students!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.45,0:06:25.70,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.24,0:06:27.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.41,0:06:28.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.87,0:06:29.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.75,0:06:33.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Wow, amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.37,0:06:35.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Time to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.01,0:06:43.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.80,0:06:48.43,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Dear me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.43,0:06:51.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Since Kotoko grew up \Neating Ai's delicious cooking,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.97,0:06:54.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I bet she's a good cook, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.23,0:06:58.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Nah! On the contrary, she's \Ntotally clueless in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.73,0:07:02.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's actually got me worried if \Nshe's gonna be able to get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.32,0:07:05.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.57,0:07:08.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko will marry into our family.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.99,0:07:10.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She will?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.24,0:07:14.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I mean that Naoki will marry Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.25,0:07:16.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,If Kotoko got \Nmarried to someone else,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.42,0:07:18.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Mr. Aihara would be all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.92,0:07:21.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So she marries into our family,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.09,0:07:23.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Mr. Aihara can keep living with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.30,0:07:25.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,and we'll all be one big happy family!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.26,0:07:31.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,In that case, Ai and I would be relatives, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.18,0:07:33.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I agree then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.47,0:07:34.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.64,0:07:37.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I don't want a stupid older sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.52,0:07:38.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right, Naoki?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.60,0:07:41.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Seriously. I absolutely refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.15,0:07:42.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, I don't want that, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.82,0:07:43.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Huh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.99,0:07:45.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,After that passionate letter you sent?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.41,0:07:49.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Will you please accept this letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.87,0:07:50.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.49,0:07:52.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,"Dear Mr. Naoki Irie,"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.83,0:07:55.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,"I am Kotoko Aihara, a senior in class F."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.29,0:07:59.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,"Your speech at the freshmen entrance \Nceremony was so smart and cool, "
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.08,0:07:59.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,"that, for the past two years, \NI've been in—"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.42,0:08:01.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You read it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.54,0:08:02.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're the worst!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.29,0:08:03.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You wrote it for me, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.88,0:08:05.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You didn't have to memorize it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.34,0:08:07.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I can't help memorizing the things I read.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.22,0:08:08.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.55,0:08:10.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Does that mean, Kotoko,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.18,0:08:12.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,that you liked Naoki all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.14,0:08:15.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Uh... not exactly...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.85,0:08:17.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Just admit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.19,0:08:21.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I did write a love letter to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.95,0:08:28.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.70,0:08:31.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You like Naoki?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.41,0:08:33.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, it looks like my plan
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.91,0:08:37.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,wasn't just a dream, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.54,0:08:41.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hold up a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.59,0:08:44.46,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I’ve been listening to you guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.46,0:08:46.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,and it sounds like you're \Njust saying whatever!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.09,0:08:48.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What're you doing here, Kin?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.93,0:08:52.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, shoot, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.09,0:08:54.43,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's nice to meet you, Irie family!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.64,0:08:58.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko and I were classmates at Tonan High School.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.31,0:09:00.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The name's Kinnosuke Ikezawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.23,0:09:02.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Another dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.65,0:09:07.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Dad, why is Kin here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.44,0:09:12.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I mean, the kid was pestering me\N every day to let him work here...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.95,0:09:15.74,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm gonna learn everything I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.00,0:09:22.46,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.50,0:09:26.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, Irie...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.05,0:09:28.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,About that girl from yesterday...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.92,0:09:30.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You mean Yuko Matsumoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.80,0:09:32.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She's a classmate in the Science \Nand Engineering Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.05,0:09:34.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Jealous?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.64,0:09:35.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.68,0:09:37.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, she is gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.18,0:09:39.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And apparently 5th ranked \Non the national mock exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.31,0:09:40.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,A very smart girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.94,0:09:42.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Not like someone I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.78,0:09:50.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.49,0:09:51.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Explain these servings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.70,0:09:56.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You got a problem with my totally fair \Nand equal portions, mister genius?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.74,0:09:59.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kin! What're you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.04,0:10:01.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I worked at Puffer House at night
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.41,0:10:02.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,and in the cafeteria in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.67,0:10:03.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Gonna work hard, save up,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.79,0:10:06.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,so you can marry me whenever, Kotoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.00,0:10:07.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kin...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.42,0:10:12.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Shocked speechless, huh, mister genius?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.97,0:10:15.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's pretty admirable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.18,0:10:19.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Not sure about a man dedicating \Nhis life to one girl, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.14,0:10:21.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Because I could never do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.14,0:10:22.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I hope it works out for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.14,0:10:22.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Say what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.89,0:10:24.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sorry, can I get some more of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.48,0:10:32.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, Irie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.65,0:10:33.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.36,0:10:34.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.82,0:10:35.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sudo...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.57,0:10:37.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I missed you so much, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.07,0:10:38.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Come and sit here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.95,0:10:41.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie, Irie, Irie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.37,0:10:46.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're gonna be \Njoining our club, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.38,0:10:47.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I wasn't really...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.29,0:10:50.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I taught you so much in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.67,0:10:52.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Come on, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.88,0:10:55.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You only need to come to \Npractice when you feel like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.51,0:10:59.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,With you in, we'll grab a \Nbunch of new female recruits...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.68,0:11:02.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Nah, I mean, we need someone with your skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.06,0:11:04.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll be waiting at the club \Nroom after lunch, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.48,0:11:08.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko... you crafty girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.15,0:11:12.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I knew you still wanted to \Nbe in the same club as Irie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.69,0:11:14.11,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I never said...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.74,0:11:17.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,...That I didn't want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.40,0:11:58.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.83,0:12:03.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I want to join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.41,0:12:07.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Wait... is Irie an anime fan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.58,0:12:09.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.38,0:12:13.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm Aoki with the anime club. \NWe're honored to have a girl join us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.34,0:12:15.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I love “Cutie Angel Mako!”
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.26,0:12:16.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What do you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.76,0:12:19.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Ah... Er... Actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.34,0:12:21.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Where is the guy who just came in?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.93,0:12:25.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He came in and immediately \Nclimbed out of the window
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.19,0:12:29.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.82,0:12:34.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I've been tricked!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.82,0:12:37.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I've got the wrong room! Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.34,0:12:59.34,Signs,,0,0,0,,Tennis Club Training Room
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.34,0:13:01.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The tennis club, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.34,0:13:04.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You wanna join the tennis club, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.47,0:13:07.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.77,0:13:09.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.10,0:13:13.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You didn't think this through, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.02,0:13:16.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's not like I joined because you did...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.44,0:13:18.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Have you ever played tennis?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.82,0:13:21.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Never. But they're gonna teach us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.24,0:13:25.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You realize the difference \Nbetween clubs and circles, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.58,0:13:26.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.08,0:13:28.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Welcome, new members.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.79,0:13:30.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm Hayashi, captain of the tennis club.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.83,0:13:32.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And I'm assistant captain, Sudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.92,0:13:35.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Tonan University's tennis \Nclub has a lot of history
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.42,0:13:38.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,winning the Kanto championship last year, \Nand coming in third at the nationals.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.30,0:13:42.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And this year, we have \Ntalented new members,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.05,0:13:47.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,namely Naoki Irie, who won the \NKanto tournament's high school division.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.35,0:13:50.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Along with the girl's runner up, Yuko Matsumoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.14,0:13:52.77,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.19,0:13:56.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We're fighting for the national \Nchampion this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.11,0:14:00.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That means you're going to work \Nyourselves ragged, every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.45,0:14:04.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Brace yourself. And no one \Nwill be allowed to drop out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.33,0:14:08.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.91,0:14:10.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, welcome back, Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.95,0:14:12.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're kind of late, today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.29,0:14:13.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.92,0:14:14.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.83,0:14:16.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Is that a tennis racket?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.42,0:14:20.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes, I joined the tennis club.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.67,0:14:24.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh my, Kotoko playing tennis?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.55,0:14:27.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I played when I was a student, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.01,0:14:31.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I actually taught Naoki how to play!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.06,0:14:33.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.44,0:14:36.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Could you teach me, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.40,0:14:38.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.48,0:14:41.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki and Kotoko, playing mixed doubles!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.90,0:14:45.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I love the thought of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.16,0:14:51.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Newcomers, line up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.33,0:14:52.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.75,0:14:57.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,To all of you new members...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.21,0:15:00.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We're going to have a basic test \Nto see where you're at, today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.75,0:15:02.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,A test?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.51,0:15:03.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What should I to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.34,0:15:06.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sudo will be playing against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.89,0:15:08.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Glad to have you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.22,0:15:10.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Everyone has two chances.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.14,0:15:15.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sudo seems nice. I probably \Ndon't have anything to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.02,0:15:16.77,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Ignorance really is bliss.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.02,0:15:20.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You'll be up first, Hijiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.82,0:15:21.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.36,0:15:25.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.36,0:15:26.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Ready when you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.09,0:15:42.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.59,0:15:47.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You got eyes or not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.47,0:15:51.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He ran away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.47,0:15:53.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Spineless!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.23,0:15:57.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,They call him "Sudo the Demon."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.35,0:16:01.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,With tennis racket in his hands, \NSudo's whole personality changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.32,0:16:06.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Next, Matsumoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.07,0:16:06.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.95,0:16:08.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Ready when you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.08,0:16:22.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're pretty damn good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.89,0:16:32.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Alright, done!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.97,0:16:35.77,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You returned my serve. Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.35,0:16:40.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Next, Irie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.48,0:16:41.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.40,0:16:47.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're finally gonna bow before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.03,0:16:50.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let's take it nice and easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.86,0:16:54.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,There's no way in hell that's happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.92,0:17:11.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, now you've done it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.78,0:17:39.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sudo's taking this really hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.08,0:17:41.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I feel sorry for whoever's up next.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.16,0:17:42.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.92,0:17:45.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Next, Aihara.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.75,0:17:51.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Get your butt on the court already!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.05,0:17:52.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.30,0:17:59.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Quit running! Get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.81,0:18:01.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.99,0:18:13.45,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You numbskull!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.41,0:18:20.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I can do this. Okay... just \Ngotta focus on the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.02,0:18:51.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're joining a \Nsnowboarding circle, Satomi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.07,0:18:51.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.65,0:18:54.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And all they do is party, \Nwhen there's no snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.24,0:18:55.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Jinko, how about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.20,0:18:56.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm going for the light music club.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.62,0:18:59.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Lots of hot older guys with long hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.95,0:19:03.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You guys have impure motives.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.83,0:19:10.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Who followed Irie to the tennis club \Nwhen she's never touched the racket?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.92,0:19:14.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're the one with the least pure motive!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.05,0:19:17.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,My sweet honey, Kotoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.09,0:19:19.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey Kotoko, your number two is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.72,0:19:21.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko, got a message from your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.68,0:19:22.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What’s the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.68,0:19:24.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He wants to talk with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.27,0:19:27.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So he wants you to drop by Puffer House tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.31,0:19:28.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.69,0:19:33.11,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Move out? I don’t want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.11,0:19:36.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We've been imposing on \Nthe Iries for almost a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.99,0:19:40.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I don't intend on doing it forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.66,0:19:42.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.16,0:19:43.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.95,0:19:45.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,About you and Naoki.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.29,0:19:48.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The thing is,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.17,0:19:53.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki's not interested \Nin you like that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.22,0:19:58.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And seeing you like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.68,0:20:00.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's frustrating for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.76,0:20:05.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I found a good house that's close to the restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.35,0:20:07.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Come on, Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.10,0:20:12.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let's get back to being on our own. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.95,0:20:25.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.42,0:20:39.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well... we're about to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.68,0:20:40.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.80,0:20:42.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Will you miss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.89,0:20:45.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Feels like my life is finally \Ngetting back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.68,0:20:48.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.23,0:20:53.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sorry for all the trouble I've caused.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.02,0:20:55.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.20,0:21:02.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Alright, we should get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.07,0:21:03.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.60,0:21:32.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What do you think? Pretty nice house, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.65,0:21:35.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Just the two of us, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.07,0:21:38.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Come on, let's head in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.71,0:21:57.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Mom, I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.67,0:21:58.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Is it time to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.72,0:22:03.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Wow, it's already late.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.22,0:22:07.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm just not feeling it today...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.01,0:22:11.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sorry, order some delivery.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.27,0:22:17.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm going to bed early tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.13,0:22:42.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yuki, you've got your old room back. \NNo need to stay in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.13,0:22:46.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Force of habit, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.01,0:22:48.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Just keep heading this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.81,0:22:52.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, Dad mentioned...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.18,0:22:53.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Since Mom's feeling so worn out,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.98,0:22:56.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,that the rest of us will have\N to split the housework.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.23,0:22:57.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.05,0:23:25.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.01,0:23:33.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, Dad. It's kinda quiet in the house now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.02,0:23:35.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.52,0:23:37.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,A friend of mine...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.73,0:23:41.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He's got a puppy that needs a home.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.53,0:23:43.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Can we adopt it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.03,0:23:48.45,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Only if you can take care of it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.45,0:23:49.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.87,0:23:52.74,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Great! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.08,0:23:56.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I can’t wait to see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.87,0:23:58.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This is gonna be great!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.80,0:24:02.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.30,0:24:05.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Pass me the salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.84,0:24:10.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko, salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.64,0:24:12.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.43,0:24:15.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You still not awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.81,0:24:18.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.58,0:24:36.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, you're stepping on a ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.87,0:24:38.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,As a tennis player...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.08,0:24:40.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.21,0:24:42.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're on ball duty every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.71,0:24:43.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's almost impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.50,0:24:46.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, Irie.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.88,0:24:49.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You here for a game with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.22,0:24:51.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'd hate to embarass you, again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.56,0:24:56.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Then when we head to Nagasaki for our summer training camp...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.31,0:24:59.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We'll play then. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.64,0:25:00.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.36,0:25:13.74,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I didn’t get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.74,0:25:14.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.83,0:25:16.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,They were out of stock.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.29,0:25:17.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Is that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.87,0:25:19.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It was unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.54,0:25:21.46,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.79,0:25:23.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Mrs. Irie.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.75,0:25:25.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, how'd you recognize me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.96,0:25:27.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Uh, it was pretty obvious, to be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.96,0:25:28.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.76,0:25:31.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Is Kotoko all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.76,0:25:34.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She's been pretty out of it, lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.35,0:25:36.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.35,0:25:39.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.23,0:25:41.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But, y'know,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.56,0:25:45.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I honestly thought those \Ntwo would end up together.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.44,0:25:46.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.40,0:25:49.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I mean, considering that, on graduation...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.28,0:25:49.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y'know?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.40,0:25:51.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.49,0:25:52.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.53,0:25:53.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,They kissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.30,0:26:09.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.26,0:26:11.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Have made a decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.39,0:26:23.39,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,“Summer"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.90,0:26:26.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,To our newer members,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.19,0:26:29.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,this is where our training camp will be held in Nagasaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.57,0:26:37.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Starting today, you're all \Ngoing to undergo intense training.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.66,0:26:39.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This is our schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.08,0:26:46.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sounds hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.96,0:26:48.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This is for Aihara.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.09,0:26:50.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The smaller one, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.59,0:26:56.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You'll be handling the food!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.72,0:26:58.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,For the whole club?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.10,0:27:00.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yep. Simple enough, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.18,0:27:00.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.22,0:27:03.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,When is our match going to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.02,0:27:05.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right here, on the last day.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.94,0:27:07.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Matsumoto and I will be a doubles team,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.56,0:27:08.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,against you and Aihara.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.94,0:27:09.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.86,0:27:10.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're joking—
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.53,0:27:13.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Now, Aihara, could you \Nget cracking on today's dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.86,0:27:15.74,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You don't want to let her practice, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.74,0:27:16.74,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don't be silly!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.74,0:27:18.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She'll be stretching and \Nrunning in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.66,0:27:20.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Swing practice and ab work in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.66,0:27:23.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That ought to be plenty \Nof training, for Aihara.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.62,0:27:27.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.50,0:27:28.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.71,0:27:30.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We practice whenever there's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.96,0:27:31.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.22,0:27:40.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's a lot of veggies...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.10,0:27:41.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And a big old pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.18,0:27:43.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.44,0:27:48.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,For now,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.56,0:27:51.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll just have to get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.28,0:28:02.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, is dinner still not ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.16,0:28:03.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We're not gonna have time to train.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.83,0:28:05.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie...!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.71,0:28:06.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.75,0:28:07.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Help me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.79,0:28:11.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I recall something like \Nthis happening before.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.05,0:28:13.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.59,0:28:16.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I can't practice with you \Nuntil the food's ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.59,0:28:17.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.81,0:28:24.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thank you for the food!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.69,0:28:30.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.52,0:28:32.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Nicely done, Aihara!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.15,0:28:34.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Good stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.90,0:28:36.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Aihara!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.78,0:28:38.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Aihara!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.53,0:28:40.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Aihara!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.28,0:28:41.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Aihara!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.78,0:28:45.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aihara! Aihara! Aihara!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.50,0:28:47.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Aihara...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.58,0:28:48.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Time for practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.12,0:28:50.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.79,0:28:53.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Get back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.67,0:28:54.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.50,0:28:55.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Get in a stance.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.30,0:28:55.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.84,0:28:56.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And hit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.22,0:29:01.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Get back into position, fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.59,0:29:02.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.93,0:29:03.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And hit, fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.64,0:29:04.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.18,0:29:06.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don't dodge. Focus on the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.68,0:29:07.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.85,0:29:12.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Poor Aihara.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.06,0:29:15.11,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie doesn’t need to be so strict.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.11,0:29:16.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're{\i0} saying that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.78,0:29:21.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Stop avoiding the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.70,0:29:25.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,1, 2, 1, 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.29,0:29:27.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,1, 2, 1, 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.87,0:29:29.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,1, 2, 1, 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.25,0:29:31.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,1, 2—
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.09,0:29:46.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie... so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.81,0:30:28.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.31,0:30:32.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,you've been doing a good job \Nwith your intensive training.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.69,0:30:34.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I’ll give you a kiss as a reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.81,0:30:39.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.91,0:30:52.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.59,0:30:59.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.09,0:31:02.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You keep leaving practice in the evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.59,0:31:04.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Granted, I know I said you were a special case...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.93,0:31:06.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But tomorrow's the last day of the training camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.76,0:31:09.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Would you mind coaching some our promising newbies?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.39,0:31:12.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.39,0:31:14.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Why not, Aihara?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.14,0:31:16.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Er, no reason...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.40,0:31:17.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.19,0:31:18.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Is that OK, Irie?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.56,0:31:20.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.65,0:31:21.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.57,0:31:22.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.11,0:31:24.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.32,0:31:27.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.54,0:31:33.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.42,0:31:36.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's... burnt.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.42,0:31:37.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.38,0:31:38.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, freshman.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.54,0:31:39.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You try it, first.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.92,0:31:41.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.43,0:31:48.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.06,0:31:53.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What's going on here, Aihara?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.77,0:31:55.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.64,0:31:59.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,All that other cooking... wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.69,0:32:00.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Who made that then?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.27,0:32:03.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Who was missing from evening practice...?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.57,0:32:07.70,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Wait, Irie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.12,0:32:19.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This is going to be annoying. \NLet's head out. I need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.63,0:32:21.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah, alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.86,0:32:54.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I've been interested in you all \Nthrough middle and high school, Irie.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.99,0:32:59.04,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I actually planned on getting in Tokyo U, \Nsince that's where you were headed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.50,0:33:01.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And then, during the center exam...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.33,0:33:03.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I ended up next to you, by coincedence.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.63,0:33:05.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thank you for what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.05,0:33:08.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You remember I loaned you that pencil?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.80,0:33:09.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.26,0:33:11.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.97,0:33:15.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But then you ended up going to \NTonan University instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.18,0:33:17.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So I had to hurry to get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.85,0:33:20.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.06,0:33:27.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don’t you think we're a perfect couple?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.07,0:33:32.45,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.32,0:33:35.74,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But my test...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.45,0:33:39.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Ah, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.21,0:33:43.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What kind of girl do you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.88,0:33:45.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Good question...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.38,0:33:47.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She should be pretty, glamorous
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.71,0:33:49.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,and good at cooking. A woman of talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.76,0:33:52.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So, the opposite of you, Aihara.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.93,0:33:57.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I love intelligent men.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.85,0:34:00.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Matsumoto likes Irie?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.31,0:34:04.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What do you think about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.69,0:34:06.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Matsumoto likes Irie?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.69,0:34:10.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.49,0:34:11.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.70,0:34:13.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But so do I!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.00,0:34:24.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie! It's not what you think!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.58,0:34:26.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Matsumoto, this is a misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.71,0:34:29.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sorry to interrupt you. \NBut it's time for practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.51,0:34:40.77,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You wanna practice too?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.77,0:34:41.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.36,0:34:57.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let's see just how much Aihara has improved, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.58,0:35:00.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Three set match, begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.96,0:35:09.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here I come.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.67,0:35:11.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.63,0:35:12.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Score, 15-0.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.51,0:35:14.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She returned it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.18,0:35:17.43,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That had to be a fluke.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.22,0:35:19.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Their swings...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.60,0:35:22.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are slower than Irie's!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.48,0:35:31.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here it comes, Aihara!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.36,0:35:35.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Out. 30-0.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.96,0:35:49.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Out. 40-0.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.51,0:35:59.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Aihara was able to hit my lightning fast serve?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.39,0:36:01.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,There's no way I can stand that!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.14,0:36:04.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Chew on this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.15,0:36:10.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Backhand, Kotoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.19,0:36:10.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.62,0:36:22.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,50-0.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.37,0:36:29.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Nicely done. We took the first set.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.75,0:36:31.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.38,0:36:32.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.38,0:36:34.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You twisted it...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.05,0:36:35.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Does it hurt here?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.84,0:36:37.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.05,0:36:38.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I think you're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.47,0:36:40.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sudo, we forfeit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.80,0:36:41.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We do?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.30,0:36:45.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You can't play on this leg. \NLet's head to the nurse's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.07,0:36:55.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.65,0:36:58.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We lost the game because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.95,0:37:00.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I didn't expect to win in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.12,0:37:04.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Why make me train then?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.66,0:37:05.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I don’t know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.25,0:37:12.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,God, if I were to say I love Irie more than ever...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.84,0:37:14.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Would you be upset with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.43,0:37:25.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How much further to your house?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.97,0:37:28.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This is why I wanted to take a taxi.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.81,0:37:30.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But that'd be a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.85,0:37:32.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.11,0:37:39.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.24,0:37:41.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,My new house.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.87,0:37:52.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, tell your dad I said hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.42,0:37:53.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.59,0:37:58.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.17,0:37:59.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.34,0:38:05.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Who am I? This is my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.10,0:38:07.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Uh, no, I live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.72,0:38:09.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No Aihara on the doorplate.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.94,0:38:11.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ishikawa
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.35,0:38:12.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.10,0:38:14.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Where is my dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.81,0:38:18.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How could I know about your dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.20,0:38:22.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Weird kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.16,0:38:29.04,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let's head to my house, \Nand then you can find yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.04,0:38:30.04,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.75,0:38:39.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.67,0:38:40.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.14,0:38:50.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You came back together after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.27,0:38:52.43,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What kind of scheme is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.23,0:38:59.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We're renovating the second floor! Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.32,0:39:04.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This is Kotoko’s room!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.11,0:39:07.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And in the future, it'll be the \Nbedroom you share!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.45,0:39:08.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Share with who?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.95,0:39:13.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Why, you and Kotoko, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.21,0:39:19.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The Aihara and Irie families \Nare back under one roof!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.67,0:39:21.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.71,0:39:23.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.06,0:39:31.43,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.43,0:39:33.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I bet you're glad to be back, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.60,0:39:36.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Dad, you could've talked to me about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.44,0:39:41.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What do you want? Seeing you so sad \Nafter we moved out was starting to bum me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.86,0:39:45.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And Mama was completely \Nout of sorts from losing you, Kotoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.82,0:39:49.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But, I'm full of energy now!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.83,0:39:53.45,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.04,0:39:54.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.25,0:39:56.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.29,0:40:00.46,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yuki adopted him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.46,0:40:01.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,His name's Chibi!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.88,0:40:03.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So, you don't like dogs?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.51,0:40:06.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No! I love them, in fact!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.01,0:40:13.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Come on, let’s get this partys tarted!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.85,0:40:16.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.06,0:40:18.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.60,0:40:18.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Chibi!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.19,0:40:21.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Miss Aihara.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.11,0:40:27.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Any progress between you and\N Sudo over summer vacation?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.49,0:40:28.74,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Progress for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.74,0:40:30.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Aren't you and him an item?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.87,0:40:32.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That summer night,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.24,0:40:34.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,you were holding each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.33,0:40:35.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You make a great couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.12,0:40:38.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You've got it wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.71,0:40:40.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Dammit Aihara!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.83,0:40:42.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Quit slacking off!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.63,0:40:44.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But Matsumoto just...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.59,0:40:45.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No excuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.34,0:40:48.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,50 more sit-ups as punishment! Bang!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.22,0:40:55.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Aihara,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.56,0:40:57.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,can I discuss something with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.02,0:40:58.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.31,0:40:59.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.52,0:41:01.11,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You like Irie.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.11,0:41:02.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But Matsumoto also likes Irie.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.61,0:41:05.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And I happen to like Matsumoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.69,0:41:06.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.44,0:41:10.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So, shall we cooperate with each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.03,0:41:11.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.41,0:41:16.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, Irie!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.96,0:41:21.04,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Say...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.04,0:41:24.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I was thinking of getting a different racket.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.38,0:41:27.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Would you go shopping with \Nme and help find a new one?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.13,0:41:27.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.97,0:41:30.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Really? Wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.13,0:41:34.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, how do you feel about meeting up \Nat Kichijoji this coming Sunday?{jaa sasoku.... ...kashira}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.14,0:41:35.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sure. How does 1PM sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.72,0:41:36.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.60,0:41:40.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alright. We're going on a date this Sunday too.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.02,0:41:40.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.89,0:41:42.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.06,0:41:43.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We're gonna be following them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.52,0:41:45.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You in, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.28,0:41:47.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm in!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.15,0:41:48.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.70,0:41:57.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Matsumoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.29,0:41:59.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.58,0:42:01.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I like your outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.29,0:42:03.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm glad. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.42,0:42:11.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.18,0:42:12.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.06,0:42:21.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How about this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.61,0:42:34.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This is cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.82,0:42:37.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Today's the last day of our sale. \NWill you be picking it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.46,0:42:43.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.04,0:42:47.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,One second please.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.71,0:42:49.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here you are, it's all set.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.84,0:42:51.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.13,0:42:53.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.93,0:42:59.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let's move, Aihara.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.52,0:43:02.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She's gone? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.85,0:43:05.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No bag necessary! Move it, Aihara!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.35,0:43:05.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.98,0:43:08.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,They're already gone! Get a move on!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.61,0:43:11.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.57,0:43:12.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.24,0:43:16.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That was a nice shop. Thanks for taking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.28,0:43:16.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.95,0:43:19.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You were a great advisor.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.20,0:43:20.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The racket should be—
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.49,0:43:21.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.62,0:43:24.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.21,0:43:30.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sudo,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.34,0:43:33.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I think I'm gonna go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.72,0:43:36.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Huh? Why now?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.93,0:43:41.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I don't know if I can stand \Nseeing them like this much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.85,0:43:42.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.85,0:43:43.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.10,0:43:47.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Boss, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.60,0:43:48.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Keep your damn eyes open!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.90,0:43:49.11,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.98,0:43:51.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How're you gonna make this up?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.69,0:43:51.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, your shirt's all wet...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.11,0:43:54.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay for this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.19,0:43:56.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.53,0:43:58.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's 100,000 yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.03,0:44:00.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,A-a hundred thousand?!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.70,0:44:02.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,1,500 is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.37,0:44:05.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Say what? Who's this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.41,0:44:07.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.08,0:44:08.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.71,0:44:10.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's a cheap shirt,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.42,0:44:12.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,so 1,500 should cover the cleaning costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.67,0:44:14.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You trying to start something, punk?!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.67,0:44:16.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sudo, if you could take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.92,0:44:20.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Maybe we take what we're \Nowed out of your scrawny butt instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.47,0:44:20.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the hell, dude? You really pissed them off!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.47,0:44:22.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Matsumoto, I need your racket.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.06,0:44:24.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sudo can see you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.93,0:44:27.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You gonna pay or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.19,0:44:29.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.56,0:44:30.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.15,0:44:36.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,My racket...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.95,0:44:41.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Come get some.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.76,0:45:02.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm running with Irie...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.47,0:45:03.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It seems like a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.85,0:45:09.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We should be far enough, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.44,0:45:15.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie, did you know we were following you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.86,0:45:17.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.32,0:45:18.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.36,0:45:20.45,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let’s take a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.57,0:45:22.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.75,0:45:31.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,God, I am so happy right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.04,0:45:38.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I might've used up a whole lifetime's \Nworth of happiness today!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.22,0:45:40.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's how glad I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.01,0:45:42.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Did you know...?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.47,0:45:43.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.89,0:45:47.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Supposedly the boats here are \Nfamous for causing couples to break up.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.68,0:45:52.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Benten is supposed to be the lake's guardian, \Nso she gets jealous and splits them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.60,0:45:54.77,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No! Let's head back, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.77,0:45:58.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We just got in the boat. Let's head to the statue of Benten.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.15,0:45:59.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.36,0:46:00.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Get down, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.45,0:46:07.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.20,0:46:10.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, it's hot today, so we \Nshould dry off eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.87,0:46:15.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, I left my bag at the boat station,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.09,0:46:17.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,it has a shirt I bought for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.13,0:46:19.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here. Try it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.92,0:46:21.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You should put it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.26,0:46:23.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You don't like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.26,0:46:26.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll take it when we get to the house. \NYou should put it on, for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.64,0:46:30.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll get changed, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.65,0:46:41.45,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Huh? Irie... where'd you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.86,0:46:45.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.33,0:46:52.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.00,0:46:54.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.29,0:46:56.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's not like we can dine in, soaking wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.92,0:47:01.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, a hamburger!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.63,0:47:03.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.43,0:47:13.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.94,0:47:18.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Everything tastes great \Nwhen you're hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.94,0:47:25.11,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Nah. I don't think even gourmet French or\N Italian can compare with this burger.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.08,0:47:31.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I wish time would stop in this moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.38,0:47:45.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,In my life...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.01,0:47:47.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I've generally had it pretty easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.80,0:47:53.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But ever since you gave me\N that letter, during senior year,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.48,0:47:55.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,and we started living together,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.69,0:47:59.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,every day has been a cycle \Nof trouble and irritation.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.98,0:48:02.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I figure...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.40,0:48:05.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You might be some kind of test for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.11,0:48:09.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And being faced with a challenge\Nfor the first time, I panicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.62,0:48:11.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I was desperate to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.12,0:48:14.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So I'm like... a jinx?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.71,0:48:18.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But lately,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.38,0:48:20.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I've started to think that \Na life with no trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.71,0:48:26.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,isn't as much fun as overcoming \Nchallenges. That's how I feel now.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.93,0:48:29.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And I'm... a test?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.55,0:48:30.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.51,0:48:32.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And you have to overcome me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.22,0:48:33.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.85,0:48:37.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So, you wanted to run from me,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.19,0:48:39.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,but you've changed your mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.52,0:48:41.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Is this a proposal?!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.61,0:48:45.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You read way too deep into that!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.99,0:48:48.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm just saying, I don't\N mind living with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.11,0:48:52.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So, you don't hate me, then?!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.20,0:48:55.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're annoying, but I don't hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.04,0:49:03.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Us having dinner together...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.92,0:49:06.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kinda like a date, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.77,0:49:18.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Compared to the time when I sent him that love letter,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.64,0:49:21.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,and even when we first kissed,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.31,0:49:24.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I feel much more intimate with Irie now.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.73,0:49:26.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Things have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.53,0:49:30.66,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,Winter
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.65,0:49:30.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You want to move out?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.66,0:49:34.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I've had plenty of luxury growing up here,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.62,0:49:36.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,but I want to try living on my own,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.41,0:49:38.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,and see what I can do by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.58,0:49:40.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It'll help me consider my major and career, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.88,0:49:44.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But, what about Kotoko?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.59,0:49:46.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This has nothing to do with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.17,0:49:47.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.13,0:49:50.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I agree with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.47,0:49:53.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Take a shot at doing it on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.35,0:49:55.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.44,0:50:07.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,353!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.57,0:50:09.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,354!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.36,0:50:10.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, Aihara.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.78,0:50:13.70,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You've been real low \Nenergy since Irie moved out.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.70,0:50:15.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're like a jellyfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.83,0:50:17.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.87,0:50:20.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You wanna treat me to some steak?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.29,0:50:20.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.91,0:50:24.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Even if I know where Irie is working?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.50,0:50:25.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.38,0:50:32.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So, Irie is working here?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.09,0:50:35.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I work part-time job here on the weekends, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.22,0:50:37.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He got the job through me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.10,0:50:42.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Now, hurry up and pick your order.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.44,0:50:43.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.27,0:50:48.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you ready to order?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.53,0:50:52.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll take the steak meal, \Nwith rice, and coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.24,0:50:53.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.15,0:50:56.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Uh, I'll have a hamburger... \Nno, the seafood casserole...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.91,0:50:58.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, but the fried oyster looks good...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.49,0:50:59.70,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Make up your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.58,0:50:59.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.66,0:51:03.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, Irie!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.92,0:51:06.46,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Uh, I'll have the fried oyster meal, then,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.46,0:51:09.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,with bread and black-tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.13,0:51:12.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Very good then, it'll just be a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.14,0:51:24.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Please enjoy your food.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.31,0:51:28.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,See? And all it cost you was a steak dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.90,0:51:29.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.90,0:51:32.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I haven't talked to him in a while, \Nso I'm really happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.49,0:51:34.45,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You count that as a talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.90,0:51:39.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sudo, do you happen to know where Irie lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.37,0:51:40.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.62,0:51:44.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He didn’t even tell his parents about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.12,0:51:45.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's in-character, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.21,0:51:49.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Whew, I am stuffed.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.71,0:51:51.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Your coffee, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.96,0:51:54.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Matsumoto?! What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.26,0:51:56.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sudo introduced this job to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.68,0:51:59.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sudo...!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.31,0:52:02.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thanks for treating me!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.85,0:52:05.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Wait, I don't have any cash—!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.73,0:52:08.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Miss, what about your black tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.02,0:52:10.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Can I drink it tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.40,0:52:13.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm afraid we don't \Noffer that service, idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.19,0:52:14.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you mad I came by...?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.90,0:52:17.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I figured you'd show up eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.07,0:52:19.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Just don't let my family know, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.25,0:52:30.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here is your fifth cup of coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.63,0:52:35.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,If you want to fail at studying, \Nyou could do it at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.01,0:52:37.43,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,"I wonder how."
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.05,0:52:44.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Shall I pour you a tenth cup of coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.02,0:52:45.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.31,0:52:49.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm not sure Irie is into clingy girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.19,0:52:54.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And it'd be nice if we could use these tables \Nfor a customer who orders more than coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.36,0:52:56.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The manager was getting \Non his case, earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.49,0:52:58.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.36,0:52:59.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.86,0:53:01.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Order some food.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.62,0:53:02.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.66,0:53:05.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I haven't had much of \Nan appetite lately, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.50,0:53:10.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Should I have them make \Nsomething nutritious, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.79,0:53:13.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.17,0:53:14.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Coming right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.10,0:53:25.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.22,0:53:28.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This is our cafe's original \Njumbo-sized steak.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.46,0:53:52.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You've got more of an appetite \Nthan I thought. Need any help?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.79,0:53:54.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Aren't you still on the clock?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.59,0:53:56.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm just about done for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.80,0:53:59.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,By the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.51,0:54:01.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie gets out at nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.38,0:54:03.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You wanna shadow him again?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.18,0:54:04.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,More stalking, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.51,0:54:05.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.35,0:54:09.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sounds like he and Matsumoto \Nare going home together, tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.68,0:54:10.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.31,0:54:11.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.70,0:54:22.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Today was exhausting...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.57,0:54:24.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let’s go home and have dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.49,0:54:25.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.39,0:54:55.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Matsumoto lives here...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.02,0:54:58.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What a big house!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.69,0:55:01.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Man, he's probably getting \Nson-in-law treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.45,0:55:03.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.20,0:55:07.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Why did Irie go home with Matsumoto...?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.99,0:55:12.46,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It might mean they live together.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.05,0:55:23.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,When I close my eyes, I can see the \Ntwo of them, happy together.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.39,0:55:29.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He said he didn't hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.35,0:55:33.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But does he actually like Matsumoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.23,0:55:40.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.67,0:56:01.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Get a load of those baggy eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.80,0:56:03.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Like some kind of monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.55,0:56:10.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I noticed that Aihara
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.72,0:56:13.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,hasn't come by recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.22,0:56:14.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.27,0:56:17.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Then again, considering how \Noften she was here...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.69,0:56:21.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It should make work easier, right, Irie?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.48,0:56:31.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I think... I actually have to give up on Irie.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.08,0:56:34.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.91,0:56:36.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Living together?!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.63,0:56:42.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,If he didn't leave Matsumoto's \Nhouse until really late...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.63,0:56:46.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That means...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.09,0:56:46.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An adult relationship, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.09,0:56:47.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.67,0:56:48.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Jinko, stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.47,0:56:50.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sorry, my imagination ran away with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.72,0:56:55.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay, three more!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.06,0:56:56.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,There. There you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.60,0:56:58.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.02,0:56:58.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.90,0:57:00.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, Irie.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.10,0:57:02.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's been a long time. \NHow about a match?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.98,0:57:03.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.82,0:57:06.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You mean Aihara?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.19,0:57:08.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Haven't seen her recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.32,0:57:09.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.36,0:57:11.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's the word for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.25,0:57:20.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.41,0:57:20.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We need to have a little chat!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.84,0:57:24.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Who were you, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.75,0:57:28.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Man, for a guy with a 200 IQ, \Nyour memory sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.13,0:57:29.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I try not to remember \Nuseless information.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.59,0:57:30.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Useless?!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.64,0:57:32.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, I remember now.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.05,0:57:34.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Jinko and Satomi, \Nfrom Kotoko's class.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.81,0:57:35.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Whats the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.97,0:57:37.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let's talk over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.52,0:57:46.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.48,0:57:47.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,About Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.99,0:57:50.74,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She's a total mess, physically \Nand mentally lately!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.74,0:57:52.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Don't you feel sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.20,0:57:53.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We can’t let this go, as her friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.91,0:57:55.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.24,0:57:58.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We wanna know your situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.87,0:58:01.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It sounds like you're living \Nwith Yuko Matsumoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.67,0:58:05.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko followed you two, and saw as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.59,0:58:09.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You moved out just to shack \Nup with another girl... that's cowardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.22,0:58:16.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The point is, stop making Kotoko suffer!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.01,0:58:19.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You need to make it clear to \Nher if she needs to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.14,0:58:21.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That’s all we wanted to say. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.48,0:58:27.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.71,0:58:42.46,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.75,0:58:45.04,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.33,0:58:46.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.25,0:58:49.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Haven't seen you in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.92,0:58:51.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.92,0:58:53.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.13,0:58:55.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I better go.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.39,0:58:57.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kinda distant, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.81,0:59:01.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Stay with me for a while. \NI'm waiting for someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.77,0:59:06.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.07,0:59:10.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you lonely living by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.90,0:59:12.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.15,0:59:14.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I spend most of my time with Matsumoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.78,0:59:17.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,With Matsumoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.24,0:59:20.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Mr. Naoki!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.20,0:59:22.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Ayako.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.96,0:59:26.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.13,0:59:28.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This must be Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.92,0:59:30.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How do you know me?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.84,0:59:32.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I thought so!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.42,0:59:35.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're just like my sister described.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.05,0:59:36.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Who's your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.30,0:59:38.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.06,0:59:40.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Matsumoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.52,0:59:42.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What’s going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.64,0:59:44.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This is my younger sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.52,0:59:46.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie's been tutoring her.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.98,0:59:48.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm studying for exams.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.65,0:59:52.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So she reccomended I study with Mr. Naoki.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.69,0:59:55.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Not sure how I feel being used as bait...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.03,0:59:55.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Ayako, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.49,0:59:59.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Come on, show me around the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.66,1:00:01.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.16,1:00:02.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.12,1:00:07.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,A misunderstanding...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.96,1:00:09.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It was just a misunderstanding!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.42,1:00:12.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.13,1:00:14.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He's still single!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.09,1:00:19.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes! Yes, yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.60,1:00:21.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I am so glad!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.14,1:00:22.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.23,1:00:31.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It’s my always been my dream to \Nhelp a young girl make chocolate like this!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.44,1:00:33.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm having fun, too!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.69,1:00:34.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Listen up...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.57,1:00:38.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Valentine's Day, tomorrow, is going \Nto mark a turning point in your life!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.78,1:00:39.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.91,1:00:41.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You've gotta fight!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.24,1:00:43.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.33,1:00:51.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Unbelievable...!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.38,1:00:56.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But... it's not gonnna stop me!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.80,1:01:00.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.52,1:01:05.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here I am!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.73,1:01:08.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Table for one.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.69,1:01:12.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This way, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.91,1:01:24.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,My stomach hurts.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.16,1:01:28.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Maybe I overdid it with the coffee?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.04,1:01:31.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Why don't you get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.42,1:01:33.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You don’t look well.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.38,1:01:35.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you going back?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.84,1:01:36.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.88,1:01:40.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The manager said the girls could go \Nhome early, on account of the weather.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.80,1:01:46.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're wasting your time if you're \Nwaiting to give Irie some Valentine's chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.97,1:01:49.77,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He's coming over to tutor \Nmy sister tonight, again.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.40,1:02:00.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.78,1:02:06.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Alright. Now's the time.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.25,1:02:12.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.42,1:02:15.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.67,1:02:17.46,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It hurts.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.46,1:02:19.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you feeling better, miss?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.76,1:02:21.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Manager,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.05,1:02:24.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for troubling you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.72,1:02:28.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie, walk her home. \NYou're friends, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.23,1:02:31.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, that's fine, there's no need.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.73,1:02:34.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's fine. Plus, I'd be worried about \Nyou alone out in that weather.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.81,1:02:36.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That okay with you, Irie?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.52,1:02:37.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.70,1:02:45.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This is some crazy weather...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.87,1:02:49.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I don't see anyone on the road.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.20,1:02:50.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.25,1:02:55.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's ten minutes to my apartment, \Non foot. You wanna come over?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.71,1:03:00.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We can call from my house \Nand have mom come and pick you up.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.22,1:03:05.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.73,1:03:20.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Stop gawking.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.36,1:03:22.45,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Everything's so tidy.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.03,1:03:26.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Has Matsumoto come over before?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.03,1:03:28.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No. You're the first guest here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.45,1:03:32.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Wait, aren't you supposed to tutor today?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.75,1:03:35.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I cancelled because of the weather.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.34,1:03:45.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, it's me, Naoki.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.89,1:03:49.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What a wonderful Valentine's Day...!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.06,1:03:50.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No! Calm down, and hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.93,1:03:51.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But, this is...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.22,1:03:52.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Her stomach hurts.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.81,1:03:54.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's just a fleeting dream
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.35,1:03:56.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,before she comes to pick me up...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.10,1:03:59.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're kidding. Hang on! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.44,1:04:03.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Dammit, she hung up.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.53,1:04:06.74,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What’s wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.32,1:04:10.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She doesn't want to drive in this weather.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.16,1:04:15.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So I'm supposed to let you stay the \Nnight, and she's gonna pick you up tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.21,1:04:24.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hello. This is Puffer House.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.01,1:04:27.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, that sounds like Kinnosuke!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.72,1:04:30.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And that voice is Irie's mom?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.10,1:04:34.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Perfect timing! Could you give \NMr. Aihara a message for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.48,1:04:35.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.27,1:04:40.11,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko's going to be \Nspending the night out,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.11,1:04:42.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,but he doesn't need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.03,1:04:45.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Uh, so where's she staying?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.95,1:04:49.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She's spending the night at Naoki’s apartment.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.41,1:04:51.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She's what?!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.79,1:05:03.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Boss, where does Irie live?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.50,1:05:05.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What brought that on?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.63,1:05:07.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He didn't even tell his family.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.84,1:05:09.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Although...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.97,1:05:12.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Although? Although what?!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.60,1:05:16.43,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I seem to remember it being an apartment in Shimokitazawa.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.85,1:05:18.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Boss, I'm heading out early!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.98,1:05:20.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey! Kinnosuke!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.40,1:05:29.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The night belongs to two of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.03,1:05:33.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Just like in a romance novel.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.12,1:05:36.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Only one room...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.12,1:05:39.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And only one bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.17,1:05:39.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.50,1:05:42.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes?!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.25,1:05:45.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Your turn for the shower.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.09,1:05:50.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Th-thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.89,1:05:55.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.14,1:05:55.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Use this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.89,1:05:58.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Th-thanks...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.77,1:06:04.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, I’ll  take that shower.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.61,1:06:09.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you nervous?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.16,1:06:13.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.66,1:06:14.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Why would I be?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.51,1:06:34.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thanks for the shower.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.72,1:06:35.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.81,1:06:38.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What are you eating?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.64,1:06:39.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Pasta.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.89,1:06:42.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Aren’t you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.73,1:06:44.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Nah, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.90,1:06:46.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,My stomach was hurting anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.65,1:06:50.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.32,1:06:53.74,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.74,1:06:56.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,To buy some rice. All I \Nhave is frozen pasta.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.95,1:06:58.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll just have pasta, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.99,1:07:00.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You collapsed from stomach pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.50,1:07:02.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll make rice porridge, it's good for digestion.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.37,1:07:05.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's okay, I'm not...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.46,1:07:10.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm heading out.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.88,1:07:14.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be able sleep with\N your stomach rumbling, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.89,1:07:24.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Stupid!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.41,1:07:39.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Dammit all!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.12,1:07:42.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.29,1:07:45.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thank you for the meal!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.71,1:07:50.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I’m going to bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.26,1:07:53.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here we go...!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.51,1:07:58.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, I’ll sleep in the sofa.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.55,1:08:01.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah, you will. Use your coat for a blanket.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.68,1:08:05.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But... I'm sick.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.06,1:08:08.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Your stomach sounded \Nhealthy enough, earlier.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.44,1:08:12.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So mean. A sadist. Downright inhuman.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.19,1:08:14.11,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Cold-blooded!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.99,1:08:18.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Uh... I feel kinda guilty now.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.70,1:08:22.70,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can see why you would.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.92,1:08:33.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey. This place isn't haunted, is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.76,1:08:34.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.84,1:08:36.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you cold?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.05,1:08:37.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah, I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.68,1:08:38.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.39,1:08:45.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So annoying... have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.35,1:08:48.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I guess it is just the two of us, all night.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.73,1:08:50.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How about a kiss?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.23,1:08:52.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Or would you want more...?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.19,1:08:53.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.57,1:08:59.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, regardless of what you want, \NI'm not trying anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.70,1:09:01.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.20,1:09:04.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh... good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.67,1:09:15.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you feeling down again?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.30,1:09:18.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How could I?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.18,1:09:22.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I don't want my mom to dictate my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.56,1:09:26.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.48,1:09:29.77,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,If anything happened tonight between us,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.23,1:09:32.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'd be falling right into her little plot,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.73,1:09:35.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,and I'd be dancing to her \Ntune for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.69,1:09:38.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I think I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.20,1:09:42.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That’s part of why I moved out.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.83,1:09:46.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So, don’t expect anything. \NJust go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.75,1:09:48.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.92,1:09:52.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Being in bed with you...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.92,1:09:55.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It feels like I'd \Nmiss too much if I slept.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.58,1:10:29.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He looks so handsome asleep...!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.79,1:10:38.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Good morning. Did you sleep well?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.51,1:10:41.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No. I was too focused on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.26,1:10:42.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, you!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.51,1:10:44.43,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You looked ridiculous in your sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.85,1:10:45.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.52,1:10:52.81,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,“Spring”
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.77,1:10:56.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Chibi's grown a lot, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.94,1:11:01.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're the only one who doesn't grow up, Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.99,1:11:09.70,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,“The 2nd year on campus”
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.46,1:11:20.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.76,1:11:24.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's been a year since we joined up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.55,1:11:26.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Time flies.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.18,1:11:28.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And you're still the ball girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.47,1:11:30.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You've made no progress.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.85,1:11:32.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.94,1:11:35.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I actually have a message from your mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.56,1:11:36.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.81,1:11:39.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,A friend of our dads is getting married,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.61,1:11:41.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,and they're all going to Kyushu tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.11,1:11:45.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So, since Yuki and I will \Nbe watching the house,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.07,1:11:48.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to call you\N if anything happens.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.66,1:11:49.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.12,1:11:52.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.75,1:11:56.04,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Ayako! Congratulations on making it into Tonan U.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.46,1:11:58.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you joining the tennis club?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.00,1:11:58.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Glad to be aboard!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.21,1:12:02.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Now who's this lovely girl \Nwho's exactly my type?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.51,1:12:05.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She's the little sister of the \Nother girl who's exactly your type!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.63,1:12:08.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm Ayako Matsumoto. It's nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.18,1:12:10.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Matsumoto’s sister?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.14,1:12:13.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So, you're probably \Ndecent at tennis, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.27,1:12:13.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.02,1:12:17.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let's see what you can do, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.86,1:12:23.74,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm ready when you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.71,1:12:41.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Ayako won the inter-high competition before.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.96,1:12:44.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Mr. Naoki! Did you see that? What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.88,1:12:47.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Was that impressive or what?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.30,1:12:50.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,All thanks to your lessons! Thank you, Mr. Naoki!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.56,1:12:53.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Why's she all over him?!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.52,1:12:57.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,When I had Irie start coming over to tutor her
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.06,1:12:59.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,she said she'd become the cupid for our romance...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.90,1:13:01.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But, now...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.77,1:13:05.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So Ayako is after Irie too?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.32,1:13:09.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She says all's fair in love and war.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.16,1:13:11.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,In other words, she's declared war on us.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.37,1:13:13.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Mr. Naoki!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.62,1:13:17.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What did you think? Come on, Mr. Naoki!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.79,1:13:23.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Your favorite, Yuki, curry with salisbury steak.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.71,1:13:26.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Go ahead and eat.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.47,1:13:28.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I think it turned out pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.68,1:13:38.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How about it? Is it good?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.44,1:13:40.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.40,1:13:43.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Really? That's great!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.19,1:13:47.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I guess at least my cooking \Nhas improved.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.82,1:13:48.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.07,1:13:51.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Time to eat.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.17,1:14:07.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.47,1:14:14.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yuki, the bath is ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.81,1:14:19.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you asleep, Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.15,1:14:23.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm coming in.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.90,1:14:29.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What’s wrong, Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.44,1:14:32.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,My stomach hurts... it hurts so bad!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.78,1:14:35.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, what do I do?!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.74,1:14:38.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.95,1:14:40.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.41,1:14:43.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hold on. I'll be just a second. \NHang in there, Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.86,1:15:07.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie, family call.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.23,1:15:08.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.36,1:15:13.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, Irie!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.28,1:15:17.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, Yuki's not feeling well! \NI don't know what to do!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.95,1:15:20.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Calm down. Tell me \Nexactly what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.29,1:15:23.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,After eating dinner, he said his stomach hurts. \NHe seems to be in a lot of pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.79,1:15:24.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,When was dinner?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.42,1:15:27.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Half past six.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.34,1:15:29.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.96,1:15:32.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I’m fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.22,1:15:33.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Then it’s not food poisoning.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.01,1:15:36.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Call an ambulance and go to \Nstraight to Sugimoto Hospital.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.39,1:15:37.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The family doctor works there.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.47,1:15:38.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.81,1:15:40.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll head there right away.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.43,1:15:40.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.43,1:15:42.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.39,1:15:44.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.61,1:15:53.74,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We did an ultrasound, and it seems \Nto be a case of intussusception.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.20,1:15:57.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's a condition where some \Nof the intestine folds into itself.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.41,1:15:59.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Is it serious?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.37,1:16:02.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, severe cases can be terminal—
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.08,1:16:06.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Doctor! You have to help him! \NPlease! Operate on him—
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.67,1:16:10.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No, no, it's alright! Thankfully, \Nwe caught this early on.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.38,1:16:13.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It won't even require surgery.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.38,1:16:14.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.67,1:16:16.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.82,1:16:32.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.44,1:16:33.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.94,1:16:36.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The doctor took care of it right away.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.53,1:16:37.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He should be fine now.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.78,1:16:39.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.78,1:16:43.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's like...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.04,1:16:46.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I can't do anything,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.62,1:16:48.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,unless you tell me what to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.54,1:16:51.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I just get nervous and...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.51,1:17:00.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, right, I...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.14,1:17:03.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I hadn't called your parents yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.93,1:17:06.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I’ll do that now.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.42,1:17:31.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.67,1:17:35.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I am just...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.51,1:17:38.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.89,1:17:44.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,My wallet, my contact book...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.64,1:17:47.43,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,and the the note with the number in Kyushu...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.14,1:17:50.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I forgot them all.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.73,1:17:55.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I am just such an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.90,1:17:59.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thank you,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.28,1:18:00.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.20,1:18:02.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.41,1:18:07.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was scared...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.41,1:18:08.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I was so scared!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.26,1:18:18.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It’s all right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.85,1:18:26.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It was the first time he \Nhad treated me so kindly.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.60,1:18:29.06,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,His embrace was gentle,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.52,1:18:33.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,and it made all my tension fade away,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.23,1:18:38.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,as I cried so much it felt like \Nmy heart and eyes were melting...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.67,1:18:54.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hi, Yuki. Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.58,1:18:59.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko, I am so grateful for \Nwhat you did! Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.88,1:19:03.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It’s nothing. I only called the ambulance.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.05,1:19:04.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But since they caught the condition early,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.84,1:19:06.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,he's recovering without any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.47,1:19:08.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He should be able to leave in three days.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.56,1:19:10.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,All thanks to you, Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.27,1:19:11.31,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,3 days, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.31,1:19:12.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.64,1:19:16.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I bet you wish I was gonna be here longer,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.73,1:19:20.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,so you could spend more time with Naoki, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.07,1:19:22.11,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I would never!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.82,1:19:23.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.61,1:19:25.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How are you feeling, Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.91,1:19:27.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie...!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.16,1:19:30.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,There she goes.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.08,1:19:32.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko's true nature.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.54,1:19:37.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko, since Naoki is here,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.88,1:19:40.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,why don't the two of \Nyou keep Yuki company?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.34,1:19:42.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll go take take care of this laundry.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.38,1:19:43.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.85,1:19:51.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.81,1:19:52.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.10,1:19:56.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I like how lively your family is, Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.15,1:19:58.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We've just got one loudmouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.44,1:20:02.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,My name is Nobuhiro. You can call me Non.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.24,1:20:03.53,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm Nobuhiro's mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.53,1:20:04.74,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm Yuki's brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.74,1:20:06.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I'm, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.70,1:20:07.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,His big sister?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.87,1:20:13.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, not exactly, sort of... \Nan acting big sister?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.62,1:20:15.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.29,1:20:16.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.58,1:20:19.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What grade are you in, Non?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.42,1:20:22.01,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I would be in fifth grade...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.01,1:20:23.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Would be?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.13,1:20:26.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He's been hospitalized a lot, \Nso he has to repeat fourth grade.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.97,1:20:28.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He's the same age as Yuki, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.85,1:20:29.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.26,1:20:31.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.26,1:20:34.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I've fallen behind at school, now...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.14,1:20:37.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I can tutor you, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.15,1:20:38.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.23,1:20:38.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.94,1:20:39.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, Non.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.90,1:20:42.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,My brother always gets \Nthe best grades, y'know.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.69,1:20:44.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.07,1:20:45.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Awesome...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.11,1:20:48.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll study hard, then!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.43,1:21:14.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Whats wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.81,1:21:17.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The kids who are hospitalized...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.14,1:21:20.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,They're all so little,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.31,1:21:23.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,but they have to deal with \Nthose big IV needles,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.03,1:21:26.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,and have to take gross medicine...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.36,1:21:28.74,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,They can't even eat the snacks they like.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.20,1:21:31.91,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I feel bad for them.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.41,1:21:35.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Your pity doesn't help them, though.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.66,1:21:36.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.08,1:21:38.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.50,1:21:40.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,if it was you...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.13,1:21:43.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Maybe you could find a cure for diseases that don't have one,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.25,1:21:44.75,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,or become a doctor,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.75,1:21:46.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,and help people heal in a snap.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.30,1:21:49.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You seem like you could do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.26,1:21:53.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I bet everyone would be happy, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.10,1:21:56.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Since nothing's impossible for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.25,1:22:23.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Have a nice day.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.92,1:22:26.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.59,1:22:27.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kin?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.63,1:22:29.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, Kotoko!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.42,1:22:30.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What're you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.80,1:22:32.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I come to see Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.55,1:22:34.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Do you have a cold or something, Kin?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.76,1:22:35.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.56,1:22:36.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Chilblains.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.93,1:22:39.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Wait, no, no, no,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.48,1:22:40.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Frostbite! That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.64,1:22:43.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kinda still hurting some \Nsome frostbite I got...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.15,1:22:44.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Frostbite?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.94,1:22:46.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.15,1:22:52.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.78,1:22:54.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Congratulations on getting discharged.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.41,1:22:55.45,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.45,1:22:56.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.83,1:23:00.46,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You have been a huge help. \NThank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.46,1:23:02.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, no, I didn't do much.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.30,1:23:11.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.30,1:23:14.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Still up?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.72,1:23:17.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,While I was in the hospital...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.26,1:23:20.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You looked after me a bunch...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.19,1:23:23.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.65,1:23:28.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I guess he's not all bad!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.78,1:23:34.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,“Summer”
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.16,1:23:38.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.62,1:23:39.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Boo!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.17,1:23:46.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What are you reading?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.13,1:23:48.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Is it something naughty?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.42,1:23:50.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You think they stock those in the school library?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.59,1:23:52.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.26,1:23:54.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So, hey...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.13,1:23:55.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.05,1:23:56.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Your mom gave me a message.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.18,1:23:58.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What is it this time?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.47,1:23:59.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Nothing much.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.26,1:24:00.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It’s about Chibi.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.60,1:24:01.43,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Chibi?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.52,1:24:04.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kiyosato?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.77,1:24:07.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah, the heat seems to be really getting to Chibi.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.06,1:24:10.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, the breed comes from Switzerland...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.19,1:24:12.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He's only just become fully grown, so maybe the heat's too much.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.15,1:24:15.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's why, over the Obon holiday,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.32,1:24:18.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,she wants to take a family trip \Nto stay at a friend's guest house.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.83,1:24:20.45,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you coming?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.54,1:24:26.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Or would you rather just spend time with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.75,1:24:28.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's obviously not the case.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.09,1:24:32.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, I should be able to read in \Npeace and quiet, so I may as well go.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.34,1:24:33.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.42,1:24:34.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.30,1:24:36.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.68,1:24:37.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.68,1:24:38.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey there!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.43,1:24:41.51,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You've got good news, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.68,1:24:44.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.93,1:24:48.77,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm going on vacation with \NIrie over summer break!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.77,1:24:49.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Only two of you?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.73,1:24:51.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No. It’s a family tour.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.82,1:24:52.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.73,1:24:53.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.48,1:24:57.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,it's still spending a whole week together!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.20,1:25:00.87,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,A midsummer romance! \NMaybe you two will finally...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.87,1:25:03.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's not happening.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.08,1:25:07.04,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Maybe we should go looking \Nfor a romantic summer escapade, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.04,1:25:08.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Do you want to come with us, then?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.29,1:25:10.96,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Good idea!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.54,1:25:13.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah, I like it!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.26,1:25:19.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Aihara...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.22,1:25:23.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You keep doing basic drills in this heat...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.18,1:25:24.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're a hard worker.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.93,1:25:28.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But, I've got a fun summer \Nvacation coming up!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.48,1:25:29.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Going anywhere in particular?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.60,1:25:32.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kiyosato. It's an Irie family vacation.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.11,1:25:34.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.94,1:25:36.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And Irie is going, too?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.32,1:25:39.24,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Of course. It's his family!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.61,1:25:41.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thanks for the excellent tip.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.66,1:25:44.12,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,My family happens to have \Na villa in Kiyosato.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.79,1:25:46.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,One with a tennis court...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.12,1:25:49.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Maybe I should invite Irie to come play.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.25,1:25:52.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What a coincidence!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.42,1:25:55.55,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,My family also has a villa in Kiyosato.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.55,1:25:59.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Tennis in Kiyosato... sounds good!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.38,1:26:01.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let's all get some games in, and have fun!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.97,1:26:03.43,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right, Matsumoto?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.43,1:26:06.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Huh? Where'd she go?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.02,1:26:07.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She left.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.10,1:26:45.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.01,1:26:48.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Since The Puffer House is \Nclosing over summer,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.02,1:26:50.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I managed to grab a short-term \Nlive-in job in Kiyosato.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.10,1:26:53.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,No telling when the so-called \Ngenius might show his true colors.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.27,1:26:56.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So I'm worried about Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.07,1:26:58.65,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I see. I'd better be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.03,1:27:05.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The air's so clean out there!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.58,1:27:07.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.41,1:27:09.45,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.58,1:27:12.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,There they are.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.63,1:27:20.05,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Who are the girls in the fancy car?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.05,1:27:21.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,They're in our tennis club.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.42,1:27:23.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,A pair of sisters who are both after Irie.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.97,1:27:27.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, so they're you're love rivals, then?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.14,1:27:31.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Mr. Naoki, thanks for having us.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.90,1:27:38.19,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.19,1:27:41.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm Yuko Matsumoto, from the \Nsame department as Naoki.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.57,1:27:42.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello, there.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.20,1:27:44.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I am her sister, Ayako.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.57,1:27:47.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki used to be my tutor.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.74,1:27:51.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's not much, but we brought this.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.08,1:27:53.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.96,1:27:55.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hope you like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.96,1:27:57.59,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,For me, too?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.17,1:27:57.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.59,1:27:59.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Well, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.71,1:28:01.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Excuse us, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.84,1:28:03.72,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.47,1:28:09.85,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I made doughnuts!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.85,1:28:11.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And I baked a cake.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.64,1:28:12.43,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Try it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.60,1:28:16.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,My cake...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.31,1:28:17.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stupid dog!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.27,1:28:18.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Where'd it even come from?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.40,1:28:20.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey! Sorry, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.53,1:28:22.07,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sudo?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.57,1:28:26.99,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This is my dog, his name's Tsunayoshi.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.99,1:28:29.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The leash slipped my \Nhand while we were walking,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.03,1:28:31.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,and he ran here, after the aroma!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.33,1:28:33.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So, I had to chase after him, and here I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.79,1:28:35.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Man, is this a coincedence, or what?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.92,1:28:39.09,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, Aihara, could you \Nhelp me out and get some water?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.63,1:28:40.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.80,1:28:45.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I think they bought my coincedence act,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.68,1:28:48.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,but I actually walked through the mountains to get here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.39,1:28:51.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah, I doubt you'd coincidentally \Nwork up that kind of a sweat.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.48,1:29:03.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey Boss, I better head off to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.15,1:29:04.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah. Do a good job out there!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.82,1:29:05.44,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yessir.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.44,1:29:08.95,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie, we should probably get going, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.74,1:29:11.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I probably should, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.45,1:29:13.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,If you'll excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.66,1:29:14.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.36,1:29:56.45,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,"Orienteering"
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.87,1:29:54.41,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It feels nice out here!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.41,1:29:55.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right, Mr. Naoki?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.37,1:30:01.50,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,“The 1st pair Naoki & Ayako with Chibi”
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.79,1:30:00.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,There's the third station!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.76,1:30:09.76,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,“The 2nd pair Sudo & Yuko with Clarice”
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.26,1:30:06.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, Clarice.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.88,1:30:10.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Beautiful scenery
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.93,1:30:12.43,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,nice cool shade,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.43,1:30:14.43,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,and the beautiful and cool Matsumoto.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.39,1:30:18.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sudo, we're at the fifth station.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.14,1:30:19.48,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Gotta get the stamp...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.48,1:30:22.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Whoa, almost fell...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.73,1:30:24.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Ma...Ma...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.98,1:30:27.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,M-Matsumoto, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.49,1:30:31.36,Signs,BBB,0,0,0,,“The 3rd pair Kotoko & \NYuki with Tsunayoshi”
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.03,1:30:33.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here's number seven.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.20,1:30:34.83,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko, get the stamp.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.83,1:30:35.49,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.25,1:30:45.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Where to next?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.92,1:30:48.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This way. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.97,1:30:49.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.63,1:30:52.97,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Tsunayoshi...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.01,1:30:58.35,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Fried noodles, ice cream and frankfurters!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.77,1:30:59.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So good!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.43,1:31:02.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Huh? Kin?!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.14,1:31:03.90,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kin!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.02,1:31:06.61,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,If it ain't Satomi and Jinko!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.61,1:31:09.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You look right at home. \NAnd the food looks great.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.03,1:31:10.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're working part time here?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.57,1:31:11.74,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah, you got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.74,1:31:13.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Look, it says "Kinnosuke's \Ntakoyaki" on the menu.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.57,1:31:15.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Oh, I wanna try that.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.32,1:31:16.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.62,1:31:16.66,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.24,1:31:20.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here. On the house. Eat up.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.66,1:31:19.50,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.87,1:31:20.04,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.41,1:31:22.04,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Good stuff, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.04,1:31:25.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How is it? Fantastic, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.63,1:31:26.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Whacha think?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.54,1:31:28.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's really tasty, Kin.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.88,1:31:31.17,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I bet Kotoko would love these.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.17,1:31:33.34,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Guess I'll go deliver an afternoon snack, then!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.34,1:31:35.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I think she might not be \Nthere by the time you get there.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.80,1:31:37.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Huh? Then where is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.89,1:31:39.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,She went hiking in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.60,1:31:40.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,They went in pairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.52,1:31:41.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Pairs?!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.68,1:31:42.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,With who?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.64,1:31:43.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie—
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.98,1:31:43.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Irie?!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.94,1:31:47.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,In the woods with \NIrie? What the hell!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.94,1:31:52.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I was going to say Irie’s brother!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.15,1:31:53.11,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What a goon.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.29,1:32:03.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It's awful late...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.62,1:32:05.67,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,And it's such a straightforward path.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.67,1:32:07.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We're back.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.88,1:32:09.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.21,1:32:11.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Huh? They're still not back from the trail?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.92,1:32:14.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,The Aihara pair isn't back yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.38,1:32:17.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Maybe Kinnosuke found them \Nand they went somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.60,1:32:18.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kinnosuke?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.60,1:32:21.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Yeah, he probably went to find Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.18,1:32:23.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,He ran off from his job.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.61,1:32:30.32,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey. Yuki,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.32,1:32:33.03,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you sure this is the right way?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.61,1:32:36.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We haven't seen any new stations after the seventh one.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.03,1:32:40.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We are totally lost.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.51,1:32:54.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.88,1:32:58.47,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Where are you?!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.31,1:33:04.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, maybe we should try \Nand find another path...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.02,1:33:06.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,In this situation,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.39,1:33:09.15,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,we've got a better chance \Nof surviving if we stay put.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.15,1:33:10.82,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Someone's gonna be looking for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.44,1:33:13.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.70,1:33:21.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Dammit all!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.58,1:33:25.37,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I bet Irie's all over her...!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.12,1:33:28.04,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.75,1:33:30.08,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.59,1:33:34.21,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko?!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.21,1:33:35.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Where are you?!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.79,1:34:05.70,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.75,1:34:10.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.62,1:34:11.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naoki!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.72,1:34:18.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie...!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.84,1:34:20.93,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I knew you'd come and find us!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.93,1:34:21.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,We're saved!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.89,1:34:23.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Chibi led me to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.60,1:34:24.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Be grateful.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.81,1:34:26.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.39,1:34:26.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Good boy!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.68,1:34:28.64,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey, you found them!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.64,1:34:29.89,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,That's a relief.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.89,1:34:30.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sudo!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.52,1:34:30.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sudo...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.10,1:34:34.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Could you make sure they get back safely?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.73,1:34:36.40,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,There's something I want to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.40,1:34:37.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.28,1:34:40.11,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.21,1:34:51.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Aw, crap...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.75,1:34:54.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.13,1:34:57.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Can't hold on much longer...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.13,1:34:58.76,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'm done!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.59,1:35:01.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko—!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.02,1:35:14.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Grab on already.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.32,1:35:20.57,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Huh, so how do you adjust it?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.33,1:35:29.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Try now.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.16,1:35:29.79,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.04,1:35:32.00,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Hey Kin,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.00,1:35:33.92,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,you're not gonna go hang out with Kotoko?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.92,1:35:35.58,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Are you too busy?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.00,1:35:37.38,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I owe Irie now.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.02,1:35:57.94,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,So, where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.70,1:36:10.16,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I get to go on this lovely trip with Irie...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.58,1:36:13.54,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But there's almost no chances
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.54,1:36:15.33,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,to be alone with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.92,1:36:20.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.44,1:37:22.73,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,All this beautiful nature...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.73,1:37:25.78,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,If I could be alone with Irie here,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.78,1:37:29.20,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,it'd be so romantic.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.49,1:37:32.62,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.33,1:37:36.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.83,1:37:40.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.54,1:37:42.71,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Irie?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.34,1:37:44.63,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,What’s wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.88,1:37:47.26,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,There's a pretty river over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.72,1:37:49.30,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Care for a walk?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.47,1:37:51.18,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.23,1:37:57.56,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.39,1:38:02.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Somehow you seem different today.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.25,1:38:20.42,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Come and sit here.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.42,1:38:21.29,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.22,1:38:31.14,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Listen..
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.55,1:38:33.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You always talk about how you like me,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.30,1:38:36.22,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,but do you know how I feel?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.85,1:38:40.10,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,How you feel?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.10,1:38:42.98,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I'd guess you don't really see me that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.98,1:38:43.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.27,1:38:45.52,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,You're wrong, there.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.71,1:39:06.88,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Another one?!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.27,1:39:20.68,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,A dream...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.64,1:39:22.39,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.90,1:39:28.36,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,But for some reason
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.86,1:39:31.86,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I can feel the sensation on my lips.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.13,1:39:50.13,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Naokie Irie: Kanta Sato (EXILE Theater Group)
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.80,1:39:55.80,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kotoko Aihara: Reina Visa
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.60,1:40:01.60,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Satomi Ishikawa: Nonoka Yamaguchi (E-girls)
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.81,1:40:06.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Kinnosuke Ikezawa: Shimon Okura
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.69,1:40:12.69,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Jinko Komori: Atsuki Tomori
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.28,1:40:18.28,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Sudo: Tetsuya Makita
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.83,1:41:51.84,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Producers:  Atsushi Ichikawa  Koji Hyakutake
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.41,1:43:52.25,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Director & Script: Minoru Mizoguchi
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.31,1:44:10.77,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,It was so much fun...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.77,1:44:12.27,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,This summer vacation.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.77,1:44:16.02,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,Our relationship hasn't really changed,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.52,1:44:17.81,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,but...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.81,1:44:20.23,Dialogue,BBB,0,0,0,,I was still able to kiss him, in my dreams.
